# Assignment 3 — Advanced CSS (Flexbox & Grid)

This project is my submission for Assignment 3.  
The theme of my website is **Movies**.  

## Project Structure
index.html → Home page (movie cards using Flexbox)  
layout.html → Layout page (movie news article using CSS Grid)  
gallery.html → Gallery page (at least 9 movie posters using CSS Grid)  
portfolio.html → Portfolio page (my favorite movies using Flexbox + Grid)  
css/style.css → Shared stylesheet  
images/ → Contains images used on the site  
report.docx → Report with explanations and screenshots  
screenshots/ → Screenshots used in the report  

## How to Open
1. Download and unzip the project folder.  
2. Open index.html in any web browser (Chrome, Firefox, Edge, etc.).  
3. Use the navigation bar at the top to switch between pages.  

## Notes
The website is fully responsive (works on desktop and mobile).  
All styling is done with **Flexbox** and **CSS Grid**.  
